From 1cd3b2ae1c6a789a0afea29b8b95956783c4e225 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Varun Sharma <vsharma@habana.ai>
Date: Thu, 15 Jul 2021 21:12:27 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] [SW-44448] gaudi2: load arcs pid and mgmt from preboot

This patch adds support to load and run arc pid and arc mgmt images
received from gaudi2-boot-fit.itb via host/lkd.
Images are copied to respective iccm/dccm area via memcpy io block from
sp sram.

Change-Id: I8c75ebaf82c5f4253be2c403c8673075fdc3b347
Signed-off-by: Varun Sharma <vsharma@habana.ai>
---

